## Reading a Prediction Line Yourself

You just saw how to read Miles = 4 off the line to find Cost = $9. Now try it yourself with any input: move the slider, watch the dashed guide lines trace the path, and read the predicted cost.

<div style="width:100%; border-radius:10px; overflow:hidden; margin:20px 0;">
  <iframe
    src="https://amandadennard-dotcom.github.io/AIFY2/unit-2/prediction-line-reader.html"
    width="100%"
    height="1000"
    frameborder="0"
    scrolling="no"
    title="Interactive: read a prediction off a regression line for any input">
  </iframe>
</div>


